  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 804.02 Notification of Eligibility Determination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 804.02 Notification of Eligibility Determination. The department shall send a written determination of eligibility to the applicant and the municipality within which the property is located as specified in RSA 147-F:10, I and II.\n\nSource. #8809, eff 1-26-07; ss by #10833, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14421, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
